{"id":3928,"date":"2025-05-26T09:09:06","date_gmt":"2025-05-26T09:09:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=3928"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:51:16","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:51:16","slug":"tiktok-creator-marketplace","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/tiktok-creator-marketplace\/","title":{"rendered":"TikTok Creator Marketplace: C\u1ea7u n\u1ed1i th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 creator."},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"FphddYyCVoCUuEx2MtAle3mVgVc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTCIdl4oaosNX9xwv0ilG0f8gub\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea5t m\u00e0u m\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 g\u1ea7n g\u0169i. Tuy nhi\u00ean, \u0111\u1ec3 tri\u1ec3n khai m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean TikTok, vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang creator ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 then ch\u1ed1t. \u0110\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft th\u00eam chi ti\u1ebft, \u0111\u1ec3 <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon<\/strong> <\/a>c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay sau \u0111\u00e2y.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UcZidfrJ9o9kNPxos8Llv3MlgGf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">TikTok Creator Marketplace l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RdDfdGFmeoW35XxiytPljtZRgkf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Creator Marketplace (TCM) hay c\u00f2n g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 Th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c ra m\u1eaft v\u00e0o n\u0103m 2019 do TikTok ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 <strong>c\u1ea7u n\u1ed1i chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn<\/strong> gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng qua ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 s\u0129 tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3949\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3949\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3949\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9.png\" alt=\"TikTok Creator Marketplace\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3949\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Creator Marketplace<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VcwVdWxiFogYeWxfUzal0txHgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OsVOd1SP1oR2jKxFZFTlqs3zg4c\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a TikTok Creator Marketplace.<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FlZpdkZ7eo1YekxsDrClEwmEgFd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Creator Marketplace (TCM) ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i hai chi\u1ec1u, k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table class=\"ace-table\" style=\"width: 98.6054%;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"196;810\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"196\" \/>\n<col width=\"810\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 25.0248%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FTjod5mr4oOdaQxUniolZrCAg3e\"><strong>PH\u01af\u01a0NG TH\u1ee8C<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 117.884%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DGnKdm0hCo5cXlxkGhvlNd3Egzq\"><strong>C\u00c1CH HO\u1ea0T \u0110\u1ed8NG <\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 25.0248%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bm7gdtot7oAJHuxfoGvlHdmPgXo\"><strong>Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0 Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 117.884%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RrUpdg9o0oqsFVx1UNvlXNPpgKd\">l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh ban \u0111\u1ea7u nh\u01b0 vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ec1 v\u00e0 t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn l\u1ecdc v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch sao cho ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean nh\u1eefng g\u00ec \u0111\u00e3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00ed d\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c (th\u1eddi trang, l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p, \u1ea9m th\u1ef1c, c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7\u2026), \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh, qu\u1ed1c gia, s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c trung b\u00ecnh, ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 25.0248%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ODeOdIXsdoX5xfxTIzzlrfxqgsf\"><strong>\u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 v\u00e0 L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 117.884%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCZJdOzmCoNJWwxwUKtlNGKJgfb\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem x\u00e9t, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c creator d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean c\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed v\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 ph\u1ea1m vi ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 25.0248%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VVkddVmG5oa8GGxnTuFl9sJggGe\"><strong>Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u00e0 G\u1eedi l\u1eddi m\u1eddi<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 117.884%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RO7udEM3foq5S1xAmlKlscR7gle\">Sau qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 v\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn, c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0a ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u00e0 g\u1eedi l\u1eddi m\u1eddi h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c creators \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 25.0248%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YJg2dL2sCoRx2ExL0RQlhHQzgQc\"><strong>Th\u1ecfa thu\u1eadn &amp; tri\u1ec3n khai chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 117.884%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AMcYdx4cuovIihxAXPVlbpm7gog\">Creator v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p s\u1ebd th\u1ea3o lu\u1eadn v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0a ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung video, th\u1eddi gian b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u00e0 k\u1ebft th\u00fac cam k\u1ebft, chi ph\u00ed, c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00e0nh ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u \u0111i\u1ec1u kh\u00e1c. Sau khi \u0111\u1ed3ng thu\u1eadn, m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u00fang quy tr\u00ecnh. Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y gi\u00fap <strong>\u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u00ednh minh b\u1ea1ch, r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u00f4i b\u00ean c\u00f9ng c\u00f3 l\u1ee3i<\/strong>, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 25.0248%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AYdzdSagWoljV9xUrYPlBw13g5b\"><strong>Theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch Hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 117.884%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UNdBdrzQ2oab5cxFARdlNYqLgDe\">Sau khi n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i tr\u00ean TikTok th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c creator, doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0: s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c (like, comment, share), t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau. B\u00e1o c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a TikTok Creator Marketplace cung c\u1ea5p b\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n minh b\u1ea1ch, gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch v\u00e0 t\u1eebng creator. T\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng trong c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch ti\u1ebfp theo.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 25.0248%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JSs6dSLs6oQGz3xqX3olVEuugcg\"><strong>Thanh to\u00e1n<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 117.884%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ClBodi6CXoVNHzx8K4olqYvDg4g\">l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c gi\u1eefa doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 creator tr\u00ean TikTok Creator Marketplace. Khi c\u1ea3 hai b\u00ean \u0111\u00e3 th\u1ed1ng nh\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung, k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch \u0111\u1ea1t y\u00eau c\u1ea7u, qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh thanh to\u00e1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh minh b\u1ea1ch, r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng qua h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn s\u1ef1 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng gi\u1eefa hai b\u00ean.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XKSxdgCSlookSnxes6HlImeYg0K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-EroSdfGYZoFQjzxt8zOl4dlwgGb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Creator Marketplace.<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KvgodWXE3oMDXGxseV7loa5Og0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Creator Marketplace (TCM) mang l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch thi\u1ebft th\u1ef1c cho c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111ang t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm s\u1ef1 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi creator\/influencer ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng. T\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn n\u0103m 2025, TCM \u0111\u00e3 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i h\u01a1n 800.000 nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u, trong \u0111\u00f3 kho\u1ea3ng 20.000 creator \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb Vi\u1ec7t Nam, ph\u1ee7 r\u1ed9ng nhi\u1ec1u l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c nh\u01b0 l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p, th\u1eddi trang, \u1ea9m th\u1ef1c, c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7,&#8230;<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ModUdt4vjodr5GxxuQelJ7mugac\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng Influencers \u0111\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea3o<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J9MDdTQouo1HEsxMBU3lyanagub\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok l\u00e0 n\u01a1i quy t\u1ee5 h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u influencer t\u1eeb nhi\u1ec1u l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c kh\u00e1c nhau nh\u01b0 l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p, th\u1eddi trang, gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c, c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7, lifestyle,&#8230; gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u s\u1ef1 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho t\u1eebng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u00e0 h\u1ecd mu\u1ed1n nh\u1eafm \u0111\u1ebfn.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ghi3drz5aohBg7xMhlJlUT1HgHe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5, n\u1ebfu ph\u00e2n kh\u00fac kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u00f3m cao c\u1ea5p, doanh nghi\u1ec7p s\u1ebd \u01b0u ti\u00ean h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi c\u00e1c influencer c\u00f3 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, phong c\u00e1ch s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady v\u00e0 s\u1ee9c thuy\u1ebft ph\u1ee5c. Ng\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea1i, v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u1ed5 th\u00f4ng, gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t, h\u1ecd c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn nh\u1eefng creator th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n, g\u1ea7n g\u0169i, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u1ed1 \u0111\u00f4ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3948\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3948\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3948\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-1.png\" alt=\"Theo d\u1eef li\u1ec7u t\u1eeb Statista (2020) - c\u00f3 kho\u1ea3ng 106.000 influencers tr\u00ean TikTok to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3948\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Theo d\u1eef li\u1ec7u t\u1eeb Statista (2020) &#8211; c\u00f3 kho\u1ea3ng 106.000 influencers tr\u00ean TikTok to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"FphddYyCVoCUuEx2MtAle3mVgVc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Nb0JdAylbojLc0xpfDTlawFzgac\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng Creator<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KPuTdtEtPoegZbxDPo0lI4ARgVk\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8220;C\u1ea7u n\u1ed1i th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 creator&#8221; l\u00e0 c\u00e2u ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n r\u1ecf vi\u1ec7c khi k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng Creator vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung viral, g\u1ea7n g\u0169i, t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean h\u01a1n. B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f2n t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng), k\u00e9o traffic v\u1ec1 TikTok Shop. H\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u1ebb, Gen Z, y\u00eau th\u00edch n\u1ed9i dung h\u00e0i h\u01b0\u1edbc, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DBcedSGK1oFmklxHnhblu9ZbgFc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">TikTok Creator Marketplace cung c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PacXd70kSo52NIxDfBvl7Orzgoc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 creator m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n \u2013 t\u1eeb l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n, phong c\u00e1ch n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ebfn portfolio \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u2013 m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u1ed7 m\u00e1y ph\u00e2n t\u00edch m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t b\u1ee9c tranh d\u1eef li\u1ec7u chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn kinh ng\u1ea1c. Doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 n\u1eafm b\u1eaft ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c t\u1eeb <strong>\u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: 60% thu\u1ed9c nh\u00f3m 18-24 tu\u1ed5i), gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: 70% n\u1eef), v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: TP.HCM 45%, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i 30%)<\/strong>, cho \u0111\u1ebfn <strong>s\u1edf th\u00edch c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \u0111am m\u00ea th\u1eddi trang b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng, th\u00edch du l\u1ecbch kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1) v\u00e0 khung gi\u1edd h\u1ecd ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng online s\u00f4i n\u1ed5i nh\u1ea5t<\/strong> gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u01b0a ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c creator m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch s\u1eafc b\u00e9n, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-ZnZFdJubyoYjy7xWxbHlHKuWgZ4\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d3fddfa5-73bd-4b4f-8a49-03f5a87c0244&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:446.625,&quot;width&quot;:794,&quot;currHeight&quot;:446.625,&quot;currWidth&quot;:794,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:414,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:736,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1.078804347826087,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWMGwbPEH2okGDgx3rJXlGNcWgXe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WMGwbPEH2okGDgx3rJXlGNcWgXe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:823010,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d3fddfa5-73bd-4b4f-8a49-03f5a87c0244&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:446.625,&quot;width&quot;:794,&quot;currHeight&quot;:446.625,&quot;currWidth&quot;:794,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:414,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:736,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1.078804347826087,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWMGwbPEH2okGDgx3rJXlGNcWgXe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WMGwbPEH2okGDgx3rJXlGNcWgXe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:823010,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3947\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3947\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3947\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-1.png\" alt=\"TikTok Creator Marketplace cung c\u1ea5p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 influencers\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3947\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Creator Marketplace cung c\u1ea5p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 influencers<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"FphddYyCVoCUuEx2MtAle3mVgVc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-NZGEd1zU8ox6FgxK2Ejl57JTgWS\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp d\u1eef li\u1ec7u TikTok Creator Marketplace API<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UFsrd6bdaoSQEYxicZRlIAMsghd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u1edbi c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p ho\u1eb7c agency l\u1edbn, vi\u1ec7c t\u00edch h\u1ee3p API c\u1ee7a TikTok Creator Marketplace cho ph\u00e9p t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00f3a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh search, analytics v\u00e0 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a influencer. Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y gi\u00fap ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian, t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t trong h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DDXRdQ3YOovIR3xh8FxlUDfMg7H\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nh\u1edd v\u00e0o nh\u1eefng l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf \u0111\u00f3, h\u01a1n 70% doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u00e3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TCM ghi nh\u1eadn s\u1ef1 gia t\u0103ng trong m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, v\u00e0 tr\u00ean 50% chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 tham gia c\u1ee7a creator t\u1eeb TCM \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u01b0\u1ee3t k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L0qedGyhPo8h3kxPwn3lWYq0gVh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Y0Vnd8wMcoSk13xXed7lxU0SgZc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c TikTok Creator Marketplace<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AYuHdPD01oGdQAx3540lpyiIgvg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thay v\u00ec t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng t\u1eebng influencer tr\u00ean TikTok Creator Marketplace, doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng API (giao di\u1ec7n l\u1eadp tr\u00ecnh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng) \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ecdc v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i c\u00e1c Creator theo ti\u00eau ch\u00ed c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 (\u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c, l\u01b0\u1ee3ng follower, khu v\u1ef1c\u2026). Song song \u0111\u00f3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p s\u1ebd xem hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c (l\u01b0\u1ee3t view, l\u01b0\u1ee3t t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c, CTR\u2026) v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a Creator c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u hay kh\u00f4ng. Cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng l\u00e0 heo d\u00f5i ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 real-time nh\u01b0 video n\u00e0o \u0111ang hot, trending&#8230;<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ibgmd4cXwoBifmxk725lyTC9gJX\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00e0 truy c\u1eadp TCM<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QX5GdoYxGo1iykxA2ablSjyfg8o\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean c\u1ea7n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n l\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n tr\u00ean TikTok, sau khi x\u00e1c minh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00f4ng tin doanh nghi\u1ec7p, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1nng s\u1ebd c\u1ea5p quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XqAkdqUXIo9Bh9xKx2GlWDBOggf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn Creator<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVOyd3JwdoZu7gxjyWmlckJ4gtd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p s\u1ebd l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm c\u00e1c creator v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn l\u1ecdc nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng tin, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1eb7c h\u00e0ng m\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u00f3 \u0111ang kinh doanh. Nh\u1eb1m khoanh v\u00f9ng v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1c h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u s\u1ebd nh\u00ecn th\u1ea5y s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-YMZsdEorno2OCaxXhWVlB0AKgAe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e1a39442-43bd-486b-bca5-fca12f12b4fd&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:414,&quot;width&quot;:736,&quot;currHeight&quot;:414,&quot;currWidth&quot;:736,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:414,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:736,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDD8qbV4emowTeKxgHq7lBcy2gnd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DD8qbV4emowTeKxgHq7lBcy2gnd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:756648,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e1a39442-43bd-486b-bca5-fca12f12b4fd&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:414,&quot;width&quot;:736,&quot;currHeight&quot;:414,&quot;currWidth&quot;:736,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:414,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:736,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDD8qbV4emowTeKxgHq7lBcy2gnd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DD8qbV4emowTeKxgHq7lBcy2gnd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:756648,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3950\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3950\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3950\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/10.png\" alt=\"T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn Creator ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/10.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/10-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/10-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/10-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/10-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3950\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn Creator ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"FphddYyCVoCUuEx2MtAle3mVgVc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ok1FdyqCfoNqHKxqGxtlF2m1gZ3\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Kh\u1edfi t\u1ea1o chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AiaMdDpM0oheomxBVAgl9pGtgKb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi \u0111\u00e3 t\u00ecm ra creator, b\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u1ebfp theo l\u00e0 kh\u1edfi t\u1ea1o chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch. Doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 n\u1ed9i dung brief, b\u1ed9 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft, b\u1ed9 count-down c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch chi ti\u1ebft cho t\u1eebng h\u1ea1ng m\u1ee5c : quay video, \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e0i, ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u2026V\u1edbi nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng tin tr\u00ean, creator s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3u \u0111\u00fang y\u00eau c\u1ea7u, s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea1m sai l\u1ea7m v\u00e0 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tri\u1ec3n khai m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c. B\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y c\u00e0ng ch\u1ee9ng minh quan tr\u1ecdng h\u01a1n v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o ra n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft cho hai b\u00ean h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-P00pdW9ybo8JlqxD2tmlC57eggc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Th\u1ecfa thu\u1eadn v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OMCtdybrYoz1z6xVfjvlIbiygDh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1eddi m\u1eddi h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c, creator s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ecdc k\u1ef9 brief, ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i l\u1ea1i y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u00e0 g\u1eedi k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p duy\u1ec7t. Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y gi\u00fap hai b\u00ean \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u01b0\u1edbng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. Creator sau \u0111\u00f3 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video v\u00e0 g\u1eedi b\u1ea3n nh\u00e1p. V\u00ed d\u1ee5: Nh\u00e3n h\u00e0ng m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m Maybeline y\u00eau c\u1ea7u clip d\u00e0i 30 gi\u00e2y, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng filter ri\u00eang, v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n m\u1ea1nh kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng che khuy\u1ebft \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 hashtag ri\u00eang. \u2013 creator c\u1ea7n s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t clip \u0111\u00fang nh\u1eefng y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy\u1ec7t.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DmHPdyQDYoOWF8xBtmKl5Bhvgtd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh vi\u1ec7c duy\u1ec7t k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung, doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 creator s\u1ebd c\u00f9ng th\u1ed1ng nh\u1ea5t v\u1ec1 m\u1ee9c hoa h\u1ed3ng ho\u1eb7c th\u00f9 lao d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch ho\u1eb7c theo t\u1eebng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e1n ra. Th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng, hoa h\u1ed3ng n\u00e0y s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh theo ph\u1ea7n tr\u0103m doanh thu ho\u1eb7c m\u1ee9c c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u00f9y theo th\u1ecfa thu\u1eadn c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 gi\u1eefa hai b\u00ean.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table class=\"ace-table\" style=\"width: 93.4053%;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"319;237;249\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"319\" \/>\n<col width=\"237\" \/>\n<col width=\"249\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 53.6946%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGuVdMKh3oiGMRxCgLEl7x2pgmd\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.9473%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEbxdg0F3oTU9axGqTblcwMLgNh\"><strong>S\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 83.618%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xkv2d8gY3oCmQ9x2djUl1dXYg6d\"><strong>Hoa h\u1ed3ng cho m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i \u0111\u0103ng (VN\u0110)<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 53.6946%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KsRddAqCZo1L6WxrtCUlkzwvgNb\">Nano Influencer: \u00cdt ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i nh\u01b0ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady cao.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.9473%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlbFdBgJKocFT6xCzGjleaMmgBb\">1k \u2013 10k follower<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 83.618%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BpDwd8NpHouIeuxMKJglVRBlgsd\">150.000 \u2013 800.000<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 53.6946%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SldadgM33oTukfxLHb6lrJjLgGd\">Micro-Influencer: Nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i h\u01a1n Nano, th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c coi l\u00e0 chuy\u00ean gia trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.9473%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A9ZsdOVBMoxUR4xfksElxD8KgOf\">10k \u2013 100k follower<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SpVmdXnVYo4Ql9xAdEElRJ3hgYe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 83.618%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHvdGS8MonVCLxcIyzl5C0Oglh\">800.000 \u2013 4.000.000<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 53.6946%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XjVldG9RCoeeUIx4QhLlXk9WgJh\">Mid-Tier Influencer: C\u00f3 t\u1ea7m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng r\u1ed9ng h\u01a1n, th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn s\u0103n \u0111\u00f3n.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.9473%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IK9Gd2984ophbCxRgtKlQyzmgrb\">50k \u2013 500k follower<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ROLpdVseVonPPlxGrUll2KGigcb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 83.618%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JGfOdRuY6oJmgLxKysNlZ7sagOd\">4.000.000 \u2013 30.000.000<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YnJzd3VWLotTafxS90Olc9dtgZb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 53.6946%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TX8zdGwqkozLAyxYVrzlu3I7g6b\">Macro Influencer: Ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i r\u1ea5t l\u1edbn v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u1ea1o tr\u00e0o l\u01b0u m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.9473%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YLmzdpeXVojNufxVkzblW4Mkgah\">100k \u2013 1 tri\u1ec7u follower<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 83.618%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DzBudUYiuoYAtjxxVrglTO1GgWs\">30.000.000 \u2013 60.000.000<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left; width: 53.6946%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BsbtdlPI7oFxaixqj45ldZhBgKc\">Mega Influencer: L\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u00f4i sao m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i v\u1edbi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.9473%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XvDHdMO9VoKKM8x5bNXlawJcg0e\">h\u01a1n 1 tri\u1ec7u follower<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 83.618%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CzkKdk2xtogyrmxTmfTlXEm2gEf\">Tr\u00ean 60.000.000<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U6XKdCdFAo9GBMxZomolZY7RgNo\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>L\u01b0u \u00fd: C\u00e1c m\u1ee9c hoa h\u1ed3ng tr\u00ean ch\u1ec9 mang t\u00ednh tham kh\u1ea3o v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00f9y theo th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u00e0m ph\u00e1n c\u1ee7a influencer. M\u1ee9c hoa h\u1ed3ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u0103ng n\u1ebfu influencer c\u00f3 t\u1ec9 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao, n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng l\u1edbn (l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c, chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng) trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-KKXIdSYnUoB4m9xahIKluBKPgqm\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdobdcH7Fofo0cx7eIGlxgOPgaf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i, doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t qua b\u1ea3ng dashboard g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1: L\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, l\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u00edch, chia s\u1ebb, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh video, click v\u00e0o li\u00ean k\u1ebft (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3)<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XrJTdrsmYo4uXOxlCAnlVsI7gXc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch review s\u1eefa h\u1ea1t c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea1t 150.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, 3.200 l\u01b0\u1ee3t t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 12% CTR sau 3 ng\u00e0y \u2013 l\u00e0 m\u1ee9c hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed1t v\u1edbi CPM th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n m\u1eb7t b\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0nh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ZGdrdBxzhozwApxsVL0lWrw5gSc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Thanh to\u00e1n h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3951\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3951\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3951\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11.png\" alt=\"Thanh to\u00e1n ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng. \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3951\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Thanh to\u00e1n ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div data-page-id=\"FphddYyCVoCUuEx2MtAle3mVgVc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXwddztttowrJ8xduN9l1o3Bgad\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi video ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh \u0111\u00fang y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m duy\u1ec7t \u0111\u0103ng l\u00ean TikTok, TikTok Creator Marketplace s\u1ebd k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t b\u01b0\u1edbc thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng.Doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn chuy\u1ec3n kho\u1ea3n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp ho\u1eb7c thanh to\u00e1n th\u00f4ng qua h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng trung gian t\u00edch h\u1ee3p c\u1ee7a TikTok, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o minh b\u1ea1ch v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n. Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t chi ph\u00ed hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o c\u1ea3 hai b\u00ean \u2013 doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 creator \u2013 \u0111\u1ec1u nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i c\u00f4ng b\u1eb1ng, h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c \u201cwin-win\u201d l\u00e2u d\u00e0i v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-SFrbdPEYPoTblbxgoJOlHbhyg5i\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;3f77463c-9336-4262-821d-42706e4a547e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&qu